msgid ""
"Nepomuk can perform regular automatic backups of all data that could not be "
"restored otherwise. This includes manually created tags, ratings, but also "
"statistical data."
msgstr ""
"Nepomuk sait fé sovint des copeyes di såvrité otomatikes di totes les dnêyes "
"ki n' pôrént nén esse rapexheyes ôtrumint. I gn a dvins çoula les etiketes "
"askepieyes al mwins, les préjhaedjes mins ossu les dnêyes sitatistikes."

